  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of plane passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>It also passes through&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Given line&nbsp;can be written as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Now this line is parallel to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Solve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Plane is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
